1. Upstream: llama.cpp, https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors.
   Files that are not changed here keep their original copyright notices.

2. Base snapshot: this fork starts from a snapshot of the thecodacus/llama.cpp fork, branch `perf`, taken on
   2026-09-03 (upstream commit 42f0225fe, "server : use pytest-xdist for server tests (#28298)"). That snapshot is
   the source of the commit "Import llama.cpp perf source baseline" (8e5f4b6). Its license is the one of that
   repository. The LICENSE file of the base snapshot (commit 8e5f4b6) is the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml
